    <string name="gas_chart_note">Tokyo Gas reads the meter once a month. A “month” in the chart is the month of the reading day (for example, “October” is the usage from the day after the September reading to the October reading day), not a calendar month. Usage and amounts are the bill records on myTOKYOGAS (incl. tax). Every refresh loads all the records the official site returns and replaces the data saved on this device as a whole. Swipe left or right to see other years, long-press the chart to preview values, and tap a point to see its details.</string>
